// error 45: `play` can't be proven `deterministic`: its `var` parameter `s` holds an interface value (`s.scene`), which a snapshot can't copy and checksum
// error 48: `many` can't be proven `deterministic`: its `var` parameter `ws` holds an `Arena` (`ws[i].mem`), which a snapshot can't copy and checksum
// error 51: `tick` can't be proven `deterministic`: its `var` parameter `g` holds an `Arena` (`g.level.mem`), which a snapshot can't copy and checksum
